# Only the files copied by Dockerfile enter the build context. In particular,
# local Terraform variables, checkpoints, and GitOps working copies stay out.
**
!Dockerfile
!requirements/
!requirements/base.txt
!modelgate/
!modelgate/**
!poc/
!poc/**
!runtime_builder/
!runtime_builder/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.db
